    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1602">

                <pb facs="1173" n="1057" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1057"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.51/105.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The French Ambassador to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">French Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 25, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: As I had the honor
                    orally to inform your excellency on May 20 last, my Government had sent to Vera
                    Cruz 500 <pb facs="1174" n="1058" xml:id="pg1058"/> rifles and a certain amount
                    of cartridges to be used in self-defence by the French Colony in Mexico in case
                    of imminent danger. With your excellency’s consent those arms were stored in the
                    Vera Cruz custom house awaiting an opportunity to forward them to
                    destination.</p>
                <p>My Government now informs me that it has just heard that the Carranza forces
                    seized the said arms and ammunition and distributed them among themselves.</p>
                <p>I should be very thankful to your excellency if you would let me know, in case
                    you are able to do so, whether there is occasion to credit the report.</p>
                <p>Be pleased [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jusserand.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
